{"suttaId":"tha-ap110","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5310,5328],"vripara":"47"},"segments":{"tha-ap110:0.3":"Āsanupaṭṭhāhakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap110:1.1":"“Kānanaṃ vanamogayha, appasaddaṃ nirākulaṃ;","tha-ap110:1.3":"Sīhāsanaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, atthadassissa tādino.","tha-ap110:2.1":"“Mālāhatthaṃ gahetvāna, katvā ca naṃ padakkhiṇaṃ;","tha-ap110:2.3":"Satthāraṃ payirupāsitvā, pakkāmiṃ uttarāmukho.","tha-ap110:3.1":"“Tena kammena dvipadinda, lokajeṭṭha narāsabha;","tha-ap110:3.3":"Sannibbāpemi [sandiṭṭhāpemi (ka.)] attānaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā.","tha-ap110:4.1":"“Aṭṭhārasakappasate, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap110:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, sīhāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap110:5.1":"“Ito sattakappasate, sannibbāpaka [sanniṭṭho nāma (ka.)] khattiyo;","tha-ap110:5.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap110:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap110:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā āsanupaṭṭhāhako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap110:8.1":"Āsanupaṭṭhāhakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
